{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your band, unlock powerful relics, and slay hordes in sync with the beat. Big Band Survivors is a rhythm-based roguelite that combines the visceral gameplay of the Survivors-like genre with musically interwoven game mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two action-packed levels available in this demo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two of the band's four brave protagonists against ruthless monsters and bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the first <i>Player</i> skill tree and stay hungry for more upgrades in our full release!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available in English and Swedish.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046800?t=1759664363","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046800?t=1759664363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046800/f0e9c30419415f950afac909f7a2980bd046303a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759664363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046800/f0e9c30419415f950afac909f7a2980bd046303a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759664363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your band, unlock powerful relics, and slay hordes in sync with the beat. Big Band Survivors is a rhythm-based roguelite that combines the visceral gameplay of the Survivors-like genre with musically interwoven game mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two action-packed levels available in this demo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra